<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-24T22:36:59.642Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 22:36:59 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen continue to carry out lethal attacks across Nigeria, killing an NSCDC officer and abducting a businessman in Plateau despite a curfew, and killing a woman and injuring two farmers in the same state. In Benue, Senate leaders are demanding a security overhaul after 113 people were killed, while electricity workers withdrew services in Makurdi following an alleged attack. Bandits killed seven vigilantes and abducted over 30 residents in Zamfara, and a terrorist strike in Borno killed 15 people. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPdDZORDh0Y0V5N1dWRnl0NVlFSGktX2JvZWt2S0VKUWk0MkV1Y0dWUXp4M016QkJLWmRFS0Q4N3hpcWpNRlpQTDFJMDZhaG85RENJQlZTd1piQU40ZkhJQ1dLR2pZdEloVnluY1k2QnhERzFyZ1VPc0NfVVNTektuQnlYdTdjeE9f?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOMFk0enRkelZfRmk3UmpqYlg5Z1RSaHpWbVVjSFBFVFg1enh1alBoRHFDTlI5RG5vVFNjZHZjQUJyZFEyeXBYdjJGTDRZTHg3X3BncExiSUFJT1ZNYWY3UUhPX2t5WXVVRFlwZHRaaEZKbUpSUnlZSk5WTkNxZGt0eTV6Q3Z4ZWFqdS1jZWF0ZEpia0ctLTRuY0UyTlZzSkN4UHByVl93bVdGaUxTd1lQOU1vZTcyTUpKa1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxOb1Z0azZ6YWg0R0F0dVctRE84MUVPdVZ3dFZfTVpEcGJXaGdwNFBoYjcycG1yaFFwVTk5TklfSHBFWHpXTURkanRIRkI2MFF2QlNmVHhFMHNXRVdQTmIxdVVxN0wwUHZ3a0pjbU5fSktZTTBtZllDVlpPdzVRcXhPM2RMMW84anh3QUlMdDl0a3N1LTRn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTFBWMWlLYkdnMkx4Vm40ck1EWjlEZFpyekhGNURuMFpkRWFrUTk1ajUzOU9rbjZ3X1FSMElTZ3Y2WkZmSWdESjgyLWtJZHIyNlpweEZyaGhrQjRJZ2ZhYUM1VWNVellKTXkyZ2d0OVdpYkVMNFZIV1hDZjBadw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Peoples Gazette Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https: